# i18n

Single locale list: `src/i18n/config.ts`. Do not duplicate `locales` in Proxy, layouts, or SiteHeader.

`en.json` is the schema. After adding keys, update every `messages/*.json` and keep `assert-complete.ts` compiling.

```ts
// BAD
<h1>Foundation is ready</h1>

// GOOD (Server Component)
const dict = await getDictionary();
<h1>{dict.home.title}</h1>
```

`getDictionary()` uses `next/root-params` and is server-only. Client Components take strings + `currentLocale` as props. Do not import `messages/*.json` from pages or components; JSON is the current adapter. See [docs/content.md](docs/content.md).

Adding a language is a config + JSON + loader change. Follow [docs/i18n.md](docs/i18n.md). Changing `config.ts` shape or URL prefix rules needs user confirmation first. If this summary changes, update `CLAUDE.md` Layout in the same turn.
